     On success, function ddwwaarrff__ssttaarrtt__mmaaccrroo__ffiillee() returns DW_DLV_OK.  In case
     of an error, function ddwwaarrff__ssttaarrtt__mmaaccrroo__ffiillee() returns DW_DLV_ERROR and
     sets the argument _e_r_r.

